x d'escalader le trio de montagnes le plus difficile au monde se transforme en un cauchemar terrifiant pour un groupe d'amis lorsqu'une tempête mortelle piège les alpinistes près du sommet et leur coupe tout espoir de secours. Les chances de réussite étant très faibles, les amis sont obligés de se faire confiance pour se sauver par tous les moyens.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX9k5v7JYmnaBO5E89PZ4yMfuvo.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/inkZbsZIWn7vCnnKuDT70F1edwK.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.5,"vote_count":86,"age_rating":"R","year":"2022","release_date":"2022-10-13","runtime_minutes":115,"status":"Released","country":"المملكة المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","مغامرة","دراما"],"genre_keys":["thriller","adventure","drama"],"similar":["mv44115","mv2207","mv254128","mv772307","mv78","mv637649","mv38234","mv1949"],"director":"Julian Gilbey","cast":[{"name":"Freddie Thorp","character":"Michael","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dnhpGjYztvSb2xHmP15wy0JLTSU.jpg"},{"name":"Michel Biel","character":"Jean Pierre","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ergeo2Drf1L5MkZOve9j2BowKPP.jpg"},{"name":"Mathilde Warnier","character":"Isabelle","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDqKNPhXzTPY5Wh9uAGx8rlHznJ.jpg"},{"name":"Théo Christine","character":"Rudi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rNcIPvVRdjH2GlftrXkhnLimE74.jpg"},{"name":"Ryan Phillippe","character":"Leo","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fgneZFXn0fGG1o7tMzJvHqfHHF7.jpg"},{"name":"هانا نيو","character":"Natascha","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4U4xCtzINm0zjuqSrwmEbmUxJso.jpg"},{"name":"Jocelyn Wedow","character":"Béa","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kiMYSzY9tUQef7r1jzoR6JIPiJZ.jpg"},{"name":"Gianmarco Saurino","character":"Tino","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w3bb2gUxs6goYv7mfLbO4d6E5Pe.jpg"},{"name":"Thomas Ancora","character":"Damian Roux","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rkHg2kN3eicDBoA8q3yxOC7OcHo.jpg"},{"name":"Jake J. Meniani","character":"Claude","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jG8iD6rN3FeQ3ugsttzG3xO7cNj.jpg"}],"trailer_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W-9yLEBfTIM","seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-16T23:31:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T01:31:50Z","start_ts":1794871910,"stop_ts":1794879110,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T06:46:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T08:46:50Z","start_ts":1794898010,"stop_ts":1794905210,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv256917":{"show_id":"mv256917","tmdb_id":256917,"content_type":"movie","title":"The Water Diviner","title_en":null,"title_fr":"La Promesse d'une vie","original_title":null,"tagline":"للوفاء بوعد. ليجد أبنائه. ليصنع سلامه.","description":"ينطلق مزارع أسترالي في مهمة للبحث عن أبنائه الثلاثة المفقودين، الذين لم يعلم عنهم أحد شيئاً منذ قتالهم ضد الأتراك في معركة \"جاليبولي\".","description_en":"In 1919, Australian farmer Joshua Connor travels to Turkey to discover the fate of his three sons, reported missing in action. Holding on to hope, Joshua must travel across the war-torn landscape to find the truth and his own peace.","description_fr":"En 1919, 4 ans après la terrible bataille des Dardanelles, un paysan australien, Joshua Connor, rejoint la Turquie par bateau, résolu à retrouver ses trois fils, ayant combattu aux côtés des Anglais, et à les ramener sur leur terre natale, selon le souhait de sa défunte femme Eliza. Mais rien, dans les 46 ans de vie rurale de cet homme, ne l'a préparé au mélange de grandeur, de beauté et de chaos qu'est Constantinople, et la ville, sous occupation britannique, reste pour lui un territoire ennemi où ses fils ont disparu. À son arrivée au port, il est accosté par le jeune Orhan qui le conduit jusqu'à l'hôtel Troya et le présente à sa mère, la belle Ayshe…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixJQ8u7lnCO1j7ldHAOzv3UF5Hz.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.8,"vote_count":1376,"age_rating":"R","year":"2014","release_date":"2014-12-25","runtime_minutes":112,"status":"Released","country":"أستراليا","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حرب","دراما","تاريخي"],"genre_keys":["war","drama","history"],"similar":["mv616","mv250538","mv1016084","mv632702","mv446791","mv759643","mv1687989","mv313369"],"director":"راسل كرو","cast":[{"name":"راسل كرو","character":"Joshua Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3IBZF0qCZMZ7zJYlgrH0sQzNZV.jpg"},{"name":"أولغا كوريلنكو","character":"Ayshe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ei6eYUhQFw2AaV6U5fyPptBaPF0.jpg"},{"name":"Yılmaz Erdoğan","character":"Major Hasan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nl7WulHPoP6bw4phMwp0VuuJgyL.jpg"},{"name":"جم يلماز","character":"Sgt. Jemal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n8J3f4Ua0FWM29icutaKcg6PxFJ.jpg"},{"name":"جاي كورتني","character":"Lt. Colonel Hughes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6vEaNwbOKov6yzQx15CdtrqfK3L.jpg"},{"name":"ريان كور","character":"Arthur \"Art\" Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lQwMEXNbABIN8LTODkYHU33q19C.jpg"},{"name":"James Fraser","character":"Edward Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lNzqoDoZPGhHCwp43V70GLMac8Y.jpg"},{"name":"Ben O'Toole","character":"Henry Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AwrcmZgIgBZCMU7PcVczarlo2VE.jpg"},{"name":"Steve Bastoni","character":"Omer","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gPCisCPAouIEHiO9P03O4SGIR3C.jpg"},{"name":"Salih Kalyon","character":"Dr. Ibrahim","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2yIjjrK8Vnk0Z6moNQnuD242DN8.jpg"}],"trailer_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grIiiHuetis","seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T01:31:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T03:31:50Z","start_ts":1794879110,"stop_ts":1794886310,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T08:46:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T10:46:50Z","start_ts":1794905210,"stop_ts":1794912410,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv30497":{"show_id":"mv30497","tmdb_id":30497,"content_type":"movie","title":"Leatherface","title_en":"The Texas Chain Saw Massacre","title_fr":"Massacre à la tronçonneuse","original_title":"The Texas Chain Saw Massacre","tagline":null,"description":"تتعرض ممرضة شابة للاختطاف على يد أربعة مراهقين عنيفين نجحوا بالهرب من مستشفى للأمراض العقلية، وينطلقون بها في رحلة على الطريق من الجحيم.","description_en":"Five friends head out to rural Texas to visit the grave of a grandfather. On the way, they stumble across what appears to be a deserted house, only to discover something sinister within. Something armed with a chainsaw.","description_fr":"Au fin fond du Texas, des habitants font une découverte macabre : leur cimetière vient d'être profané et les cadavres exposés sous forme de trophées. Pendant ce temps, cinq amis traversent la région à bord d'un minibus. Ils croisent en chemin la route d'un auto-stoppeur et décident de le prendre à bord. Mais lorsque les jeunes gens s'aperçoivent que l'individu a un comportement inquiétant et menaçant, ils finissent par s'en débarrasser. Bientôt à court d'essence, le groupe décide d'aller visiter une vieille maison abandonnée, appartenant aux grands-parents de deux d'entre eux. Chacun leur tour, les cinq amis vont être attirés par la maison voisine. La rencontre avec ses étranges habitants va leur être fatale…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpgkRPH1GNkMCgdPk2OMyHzAks7.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvBx1Q1FcQE1BPLfBbgA3y9aaS1.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.3,"vote_count":4083,"age_rating":"R","year":"1974","release_date":"1974-10-11","runtime_minutes":83,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة",